 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- Assign active tickets, notify agents, and filter listings by assignee.
+- Listings match every supplied filter; command-line output includes assignees.
+- Atomic bulk ticket import with creation audits, requester notifications, and one data-file save.
+
+- Persist fixed ticket due times with configurable response hours and startup backfill.
